  "notes": "やる has two main uses.\n\n1. TO DO (casual):\n- やる = する (more casual)\n- {仕事|しごと}をやる (to do work)\n\n2. TO GIVE (downward):\n- Used for animals, plants, younger siblings\n- {犬|いぬ}に{餌|えさ}をやる (feed the dog)\n- {花|はな}に{水|みず}をやる (water flowers)\n\nNOTE: For giving to equals/superiors, use あげる.",
